    "body": "What's the motivation for this change? I thought it was nice that with convertToBlob, you actually got errors for the error cases.\r\n\r\ncanvas.toBlob() has the problem of only using a single callback, and not returning a promise, so it doensn't have any way to signal errors. But convertToBlob() has the nice promise-returning ability to do so.",
