    "body": "Right, I thought the idea was to abandon consistency with a bad API, in favor of making the new API good. We could then even eventually introduce canvas.convertToBlob() as a good API (promise returning, with appropriate rejections) and deprecate canvas.toBlob(), if anyone ever wanted to do the extra work.",
